# Branded CrowdRelay acquisition routes. The browser reaches the API first so
# attribution/referral cookies are set by signal-api before the final redirect.
/go/*  https://signal-api.virya.music/v1/go/:splat  302!
# CrowdRelay executors publish tracked links as https://virya.music/l/{slug}
# (telegram_executor, social_post_executor/tracked_links, community path) while
# the resolver is GET /v1/go/{slug} — both forms stay. Found 2026-09-23: every
# tracked link published so far 404'd.
/l/*   https://signal-api.virya.music/v1/go/:splat   302!
/r/*   https://signal-api.virya.music/v1/r/:splat   302!
